cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DnLC, please cite this software and the associated publication."
title: "DnLC: Automated Leaf Counting in Dendrobium nobile Using YOLOv5"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
authors:
  - family-names: "Deb"
    given-names: "Chandan Kumar"
    affiliation: "ICAR–Indian Agricultural Statistics Research Institute"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChandanIasri/DnLC"
url: "https://github.com/ChandanIasri/DnLC"
abstract: >-
  DnLC is a YOLOv5-based desktop application for automated detection and
  counting of leaves in Dendrobium nobile plant images. The software provides
  batch image processing, annotated outputs, image-wise leaf counts, and CSV
  export through a CustomTkinter graphical interface.
keywords:
  - "Dendrobium nobile"
  - "leaf counting"
  - "plant phenotyping"
  - "YOLOv5"
  - "computer vision"
  - "deep learning"
